Output tapes/pipeline.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 500
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type "rmsctl datasets list"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 0.5s

Type "rmsctl training list"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 0.5s

Type "rmsctl deployments list"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 0.5s

Type "rmsctl eval success-rate"
Enter
Sleep 3s
